  "item_short_desc": "<p>Proudly and patriotically showcase your support for American troops in Rothco&rsquo;s Embroidered Pullover Hoodies. These pullover hooded sweatshirts feature glossy, raised embroidery of military branch text across the chests, along with their respective insignias on the left sleeves. The comfortable performance polyester composition warm fleece lining makes these pullovers perfect for cold weather, along with Rothco&rsquo;s standard hand-warming kangaroo pocket that enables dual hand warming and provides storage space (Air Force hoodie composed of a cotton blend). Elastic wrist cuffs and an adjustable drawstring hood insulate you from the elements. When you need a patriotic sweatshirt that keeps you warm and toasty while you support your country&rsquo;s finest, check out Rothco&rsquo;s Embroidered Pullover Hoodie.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
